## Overview

{{APP_DESCRIPTION}}

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  user([User, company account]) -->|HTTPS, platform sign-in| app["The app<br/>(one container)"]
  app -.->|optional| db[(Database)]
  app -.->|optional| blob[(Blob Storage)]
  app -->|telemetry| ai[Application Insights]
```

The app runs as one container on the platform (Azure Container Apps). The platform signs users
in (Microsoft Entra ID), injects configuration as environment variables, and deploys every push to
nonprod and approved releases to prod.

