## Configuration

| Variable | Source | Secret | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `PORT` | platform | no | port the app listens on (8080) |
| `AZURE_CLIENT_ID` | platform | no | client id of the app's managed identity |
| `APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_CONNECTION_STRING` | platform | no | telemetry to Application Insights |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `platform.yaml` | no | `info` (prod), `debug` allowed in nonprod |
| `DEV_FAKE_USER`, `DEV_FAKE_ROLES` | `.env` (local only) | no | simulated signed-in user on a laptop; refused on Azure |

